 e Rhodes Information Initiative's Pop-up Institute on Emerging Algorithms
  in Sampling.\n\nPlease join us September 11-12th at Duke University's Gr
 oss Hall to share ideas\, methods\, and algorithms related to Sampling ac
 ross disciplines.\n\nFriday\n9:00-11:30 Working sessions\n12:00-2:00 Lunc
 h and poster session\n2:00-4:30 Talks\n5:00 pm Reception\n\nSaturday\n9:0
 0-11:30 Talks\n11:30-1:00  Lunch\n1:00  Social Events\n\nWebsite:\nhttps:
 //sites.duke.edu/adventuresinsampling/\n\nRegistration:\nhttps://duke.kua
 libuild.com/app/6a43e63a062b02029e02a81f/start
