 t speakers\, presentations and discussions on a wide range of thought-pro
 voking topics\, including Biblical studies\, current social issues and th
 e work of mission agencies.  Adult Forum aims to deepen the faith and und
 erstanding of adults through shared learning experiences. Classes include
  programs and discussions on contemporary issues in light of Christian te
 achings.
