DESCRIPTION:Please join us on Sunday\, September 13\, after the Chapel wor
 ship service for a Fellowship Lunch Gathering at the Duke Brodhead Center
 .\n\nVolunteers will be holding signs after worship to provide directions
  to the Brodhead which is just a short walk from the Chapel.\n\nThe Brodh
 ead Center provides a wide array of dining options. Purchase your own lun
 ch from one of their many vendors\, then gather in the dining area by Roa
 sts & Chops on the main floor to share a time of fellowship. \n\nNote: ea
 ch restaurant offers a $5 Blue Devil Deal.
DURATION:PT1H
