DESCRIPTION:September 14-20 is Duke undergraduate students' chance to disc
 over the people\, programs\, and tools that can help them thrive at Duke.
  Throughout the week\, there will be opportunities to connect with campus
  resources\, pick up practical strategies for academic success\, and expl
 ore services designed to support you at every stage of your undergraduate
  journey. \n\nAttend events\, ask questions\, and check in at each sessio
 n you visit. Every check-in to a raffle event automatically enters you in
 to our prize raffle\, giving you even more reason to explore Academic Res
 ources Week.
