CREATED:20230805T023014Z
DESCRIPTION:Dr. Wenpin Hou's research lies at the intersection of computat
 ional biology\, artificial intelligence\, and statistical genomics\, with
  a focus on developing computational methods to understand gene regulatio
 n using single-cell\, spatial\, and epigenomic data. Dr. Hou develops mac
 hine learning and statistical approaches for analyzing large-scale genomi
 c datasets\, including methods for single-cell transcriptomics\, chromati
 n accessibility\, DNA methylation\, spatial genomics\, and multimodal dat
 a integration.
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260903T140150Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T120000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260903T140150Z
