DESCRIPTION:Take a break with Pint-Sized Pasture & GSPS!\n\nIt's week four
  of the fall semester\, and it's time for a little break! The Graduate St
 udent Programs & Services (GSPS) team is excited to welcome our friends f
 rom Pint-Sized Pasture back to campus.\n\n    When: Monday\, September 14
 \, 12:00 PM - 2:00 PM\n\n    Where: Engineering Quad\n\n    What: Petting
  zoo & free ice cream!\n\nStop by the Quad to cuddle goats\, llamas\, min
 i-cows\, ducks\, rabbits\, and baby pigs. Grab a frozen treat\, meet the 
 GSPS team\, and hang out with fellow grad students-all without leaving ca
 mpus.\n\nWe hope to see you there!
