DESCRIPTION:This informational session by the Compute and Data Services Al
 liance for Research (CDSA) will provide new-to-Duke researchers with an o
 verview of available technology tools\, support\, and services associated
  with research data support offered through the Duke University Libraries
 \, the Office of Information Technology (OIT)\, and the Office for Resear
 ch and Innovation (OR&I). We encourage new-to-Duke researchers\, includin
 g new PhD students\, to attend.   \n\nThe CDSA is a faculty-driven initia
 tive coordinated between the Office of Information Technology\, the Duke 
 University Libraries\, and the Office for Research & Innovation. The CDSA
  aims to respond to the ever-evolving needs of the research community and
  the increasing complexity of conducting\, sharing\, and publishing resea
 rch today.\n\nPlease register here: https://duke.zoom.us/meeting/register
 /hHrO3mMoSE-xJ5h5m09dEA
