CREATED:20260828T193136Z
DESCRIPTION:Learn the fundamentals of the decorative art of Sashiko- Japan
 ese Geometric Embroidery meant to strengthen and decorate your beloved te
 xtiles. We will cover the materials needed and demonstrations on how to c
 reate surface designs with stabilizing running stitches.\n\nSashiko (刺し子\
 , meaning "little pokes" or "small piercing") is a form of functional emb
 roidery that originated in Japan.
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20260910T202517Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T180000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260910T202517Z
