CREATED:20260907T024712Z
DESCRIPTION:Plants are amazing organisms\, with many capable of cloning th
 emselves from a stem cutting. Jason Holmes\, curator of the Gateway Garde
 ns at Duke Gardens\, will guide you through the process and timing of col
 lecting\, preparing and growing new woody plants from cuttings. Participa
 nts will gain hands-on practice and take home cuttings to continue growin
 g.
