DESCRIPTION:The Office for Faculty is conducting a series of faculty liste
 ning sessions as part of our ongoing strategic planning efforts. These se
 ssions are intended to help us better understand the evolving needs of ou
 r faculty community and ensure that our faculty development programs rema
 in relevant\, impactful\, and responsive to current priorities.\n\nOne-ho
 ur sessions will be offered in both virtual and in person formats. When r
 egistering\, please pay close attention to the session date and time\, de
 livery modality (in person or Zoom)\,and primary professional focus.
