CREATED:20260811T162059Z
DESCRIPTION:From Sea to Space: Testing the Future of Exploration and Scien
 ce\n\nThis seminar explores the intersection of technology development\, 
 scientific research\, and exploration across extreme environments-from th
 e depths of the ocean to the reaches of space.\n\nDr. Dawn Kernagis will 
 draw on her experience as a crew member and scientist on NASA's NEEMO 21 
 undersea analog mission and as Scientific Director for the undersea habit
 at company DEEP\, highlighting how living and working underwater can serv
 e as a testbed for technologies\, procedures\, science\, and human operat
 ions relevant to future space exploration.\n\nLunch and networking will b
 egin at 11:30 AM
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260901T203005Z
