DESCRIPTION:The Duke Department of Neurology Division of Translational Bra
 in Sciences\, Duke Comprehensive Epilepsy Center and Neurology Residency 
 Program are excited to invite you to their 2026 Research Symposium.\n\nAl
 l clinical\, basic and translational researchers in the departments of ne
 urology\, neurobiology\, neuroscience\, neurosurgery\, biomedical enginee
 ring\, pediatrics\, psychiatry\, and psychology are invited to attend or 
 present a poster. \n\nSymposium details can be found at the event website
 . Please RSVP and submit poster proposals via this form: https://bit.ly/T
 BSFall2026 by Wednesday\, August 26 at 9:00am.
DURATION:PT2H30M
